{
 "saintsdragons.config_screen.others.raevyx_beam_first_person": "雷鸣龙光束期间强制第一人称",
 "saintsdragons.config_screen.others.raevyx_beam_first_person.tooltip": "骑乘正在发射光束的雷鸣龙时，自动切换至第一人称光束视角。关闭后将保留你选择的视角与普通的骑乘视角。仅客户端生效；保存后立即生效",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.14": "你觉得我的雷鸣龙怎么样？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_1.text": "我觉得你的雷鸣龙非常漂亮。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_2.text": "在我看来，雷鸣龙一族是最强壮、最聪明、最迅猛、最致命、外表也最酷的龙之一。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_3.text": "我特别喜欢那排沿着脊背延伸的棘刺。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_4.text": "还有那酷似闪电的翼纹，实在壮丽。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_5.text": "别嫌我花痴，但你知道的，这可是我平生头一回见到的龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_6.text": "呃，也不算见到……更像是以一颗蛋的形式。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_7.text": "那颗蛋……让人着迷。红色的纹路把蛋壳周围的黑暗衬得格外深沉。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_8.text": "当我碰到它时，我感到……像是活了过来？而且那颗蛋当时也正在孵化。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_9.text": "抱歉，我找不到合适的词来形容那一刻真正的感受。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_10.text": "大概可以用纯粹、安宁、无邪这些词吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_11.text": "或者这么说吧，那种感觉就像是它命中注定属于我。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_12.text": "你也可以说，我是对这个物种本身就着了迷。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_13.text": "我第一次找到那颗蛋的时候，年纪还很小。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_14.text": "哦对了，我忘了说。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_15.text": "它就在一位死去的雷鸣龙母亲旁边。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_16.text": "被残害的。为了取走身上的部件而惨遭杀害和肢解。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_17.text": "我压根没想过自己会发现一只雷鸣龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_18.text": "看着你的这只，勾起了我好多回忆。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_19.text": "请好好照顾你的雷鸣龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_20.text": "在照料龙这件事上，我对你没有半点怀疑。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_21.text": "嗯……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.raevyx_22.text": "这事就先到此为止吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_tame_notice.text": "看来你是在它还是幼崽的时候就驯服了它。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.taming_method.text": "话说回来，你到底是怎么驯服它的？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.taming_method.choice.0": "我和它打了一场。把它打晕之后，我就趁机驯服了它。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.taming_method.choice.1": "它还是幼崽时我就驯服了它。就是正常地喂它吃东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.fight_response_1.text": "厉害！看来我的直觉终究没有看走眼。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.fight_response_2.text": "我还以为你现在已经被它的光束轰成灰了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.fight_response_3.text": "不过那也太蠢了，毕竟你还站在这儿。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.fight_response_4.text": "有你在我身边真好。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_1.text": "哈……那你还挺像我的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_2.text": "事实上，我确实在她还是只小雷崽的时候驯服过一只雷鸣龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_3.text": "所有龙崽子都好骗，特别容易驯服。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_4.text": "这也让它们显得格外可爱、讨人喜欢。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_5.text": "看来我们有共同点了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_raevyx.baby_response_6.text": "在我看来这挺好的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.15": "我的烬翼龙看起来如何？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_1.text": "啊，没错……烬翼龙。Pyrovela migrantis。优雅至极。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_2.text": "大伙儿就是随口把那条“面条”这么叫开了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_2.choice.0": "那是你编的吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_3.text": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_4.text": "编什么了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_4.choice.0": "Pyrovela migrantis 这个名字啊。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_5.text": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_6.text": "不、不是吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_7.text": "不是！我是说……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_8.text": "算了。好吧。确实是我编的，因为我乐意。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_9.text": "我说，拜托！这名字很合理，不是吗？而且现在已经是正式名称了！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_10.text": "它们总是在飞来飞去！而且它们那灼热的、宛如余烬般的翼纹美得让人窒息！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_11.text": "所以……Pyrovela migrantis！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_12.text": "意思是……“漫游焰翼”？好拗口。天哪。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_13.text": "……好吧，“烬翼龙”也挺合理的。毕竟它确实会飞……呃，还有翼纹什么的，而且更短——",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_14.text": "我的重点是——%1$s 抱歉。我的重点是，烬翼龙真的是一种极其出色的龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_15.text": "代步、战斗，等等等等。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_16.text": "修长流畅的身躯，配上大翅膀和尾舵，这设计简直就是为空中机动而生的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_17.text": "但可别以貌取龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_18.text": "这些家伙打起人来可狠了。非常、非常狠。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_19.text": "我认识一个叫格洛斯的家伙，他觉得像套马一样用套索去套烬翼龙是个好主意，结果差点被炸死。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_20.text": "哈！他以为他是谁？龙族霸主？？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_21.text": "而且我很确定，它们在自燃状态下俯冲砸向地面时是会爆炸的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_22.text": "这嘛……有点残忍，但不得不说，还挺酷的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_23.text": "不过，你能驯服一只，干得不错。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_cindervane.cindervane_24.text": "至少你没死，对吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.16": "对我的剑航龙有什么想说的吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_1.text": "哦当然，必须有。你这朋友可相当结实。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_2.text": "剑航龙是种很棒的伙伴龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_3.text": "它们的颈根非常粗壮。你可以坐在上面，还能在上面加装储物格。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_4.text": "要是你需要更多空间，它能帮你一起驮东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_5.text": "我喜欢把它们想象成远古的守护者。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_6.text": "待在它们身边让我觉得特别安心。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_7.text": "我还觉得它们成群结队行动的样子特别可爱。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_8.text": "像烬翼龙和剑航龙这样群居行动的龙可不多见。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_9.text": "它们也容易驯服。只是不太好找，毕竟它们住在繁茂洞穴里……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_10.text": "但这一点也没难倒你，对吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.stegonaut_11.text": "干得好。身边有这么一条龙，好处多多。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.no_binder.text": "越早给它做一副驮具越好。相信我。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_stegonaut.has_binder.text": "看来你已经给它做好驮具了！了不起，%1$s！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.17": "跟我说说你觉得我的瓦拉鳄如何。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_1.text": "嗯……瓦拉鳄。一种鳄鱼模样的龙玩意儿。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_2.text": "对一种半水生、还不会飞的龙来说……这家伙够吓人的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_3.text": "被逼到极限时，它会用后腿站起来，开始用前肢……或者说前臂来战斗。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_4.text": "而且那两条前臂上长着我想象中最狠、最锋利的爪子。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_5.text": "你知道吗，我一直很好奇……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_6.text": "到底是谁发现的，居然可以像骑马一样骑着它来驯服瓦拉鳄？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_7.text": "我是说，认真的吗？为什么？怎么想的？你总不会看到一只巨大又凶相毕露的龙，然后来一句“好啊，我要骑它”吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_8.text": "另外，等等，先停在刚才那句话上。呃……总之，我真庆幸自己不是那种人。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_9.text": "瓦拉鳄明明能轻松放倒一个人。凭什么啊？？为什么被甩几下就温顺了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_10.text": "为什么不干脆……挣脱主人的枷锁呢？这让我百思不得其解。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_11.text": "顺便一提，这条对所有龙都适用。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_12.text": "我猜龙大概就是……大只、吓人、强壮的……狗？？算了，我这是在胡言乱语。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_13.text": "瞧瞧我们都干了些什么，%1$s，我跟你说。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_14.text": "但无论如何……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_15.text": "你能成功驯服一只，应该为自己感到骄傲。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_16.text": "被它从背上甩下来，再爬上去。又被甩下来。如此往复，直到驯服为止。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_17.text": "这证明你比它还能扛。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_18.text": "我还想起一件事。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_18.choice.0": "什么事？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_19.text": "我梦到过一只紫色的瓦拉鳄。不知为何，那场梦有种飘飘忽忽的感觉。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_20.text": "那抹紫色就在无尽的虚空里微微闪烁。一切都那么宁静。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_21.text": "我一度以为自己在野外看到了它……不过大概只是眼花了吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_22.text": "仿佛它是被虚空亲吻过的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_varasuchus.varasuchus_23.text": "也许可以试试在末地孵化瓦拉鳄的蛋。谁知道呢？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.18": "很想听听你对噬焰龙的看法。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_1.text": "你在跟我开玩笑吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_1.choice.0": "怎么？怎么了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_2.text": "一只噬焰龙。你居然……有一只噬焰龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_2.choice.0": "对，我就是有。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_3.text": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_4.text": "好……让我捋一捋。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_5.text": "因为这种龙太过稀有，我几乎花了半辈子想向龙类研究学会证明它的存在……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_6.text": "结果你就轻描淡写地来了句，“哦对，我养了只宠物噬焰龙。”",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_6.choice.0": "我没那么说……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_7.text": "……无所谓了。你疯了。你是真的疯了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_8.text": "你居然驯服了一场灾难级事件。一场长了脚的天灾。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_9.text": "区域性灭绝事件。行走的疏散令。局部末日。环境灾害。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_10.text": "生态重置按钮。地质仇恨罪。地形抹除事件。上. 帝. 之. 怒——",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_11.text": "你懂我意思就行。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_12.text": "还有你这头龙也真是嚣张得可以。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_13.text": "它怎么长得这么普通？别误会，我喜欢它的鳞片，也喜欢它整体的样子。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_14.text": "还有它为什么能站起来？这都是些什么鬼？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_15.text": "那么大的块头居然还能飞。还能不知怎地掀起一阵灼热无比的热浪，基本上能把周围的一切都蒸发掉。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_16.text": "这家伙让我想起另一头破坏力更强的龙……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_17.text": "和修雷德城有点关系……唉，算了。它们八成是失散多年的远亲。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_18.text": "然后揍它几顿它就归你了？好极了。太棒了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_19.text": "恭喜。吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_19.choice.0": "怎么，你嫉妒了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_20.text": "没有。我才没有。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_20.choice.0": "有，你就是嫉妒了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_21.text": "我才没有！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_21.choice.0": "我不信。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_22.text": "才！不是！你就是信我的！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_22.choice.0": "行吧行吧，你没嫉妒。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.ignivorus_22.choice.1": "不。还是不信。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.jealous_admit_1.text": "……唉。好吧，我承认我是有点。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.jealous_admit_2.text": "我替你高兴，但同时又高兴不起来。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.jealous_admit_3.text": "为什么？因为连我都没来得及，你就先证明了它的存在。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.jealous_admit_4.text": "而且你还能骑上它。亲身体验它，见证它的本事。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.jealous_admit_5.text": "但我完全明白你为了驯服那玩意儿经历了什么。真心实意地明白。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.raevyx_extra.text": "又或者你是用雷鸣龙的光束轰了它……总之——",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.apology.text": "我为自己刚才的态度道歉。原谅我好吗？求你了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.apology.choice.0": "没关系。我原谅你。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.apology.choice.1": "不，我才不原谅。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.forgiven.text": "太好了！咱们翻篇吧。反正也没那么严重。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.not_forgiven_1.text": "好啊。我要走了。再见。别想劝我回来。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.not_forgiven_2.text": "……我开玩笑的！哈哈！你真该看看你刚才那表情！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.not_forgiven_3.text": "没事的。这种你来我往我很喜欢。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_ignivorus.not_forgiven_4.text": "继续吧。反正也没那么严重。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.19": "谈谈你对我的惊澜龙的看法吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_1.text": "我的天……真的假的？惊澜龙？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_2.text": "跟你说件事。它们是入侵物种。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_3.text": "前一秒，你还在水下游泳，自顾自地忙着自己的事，啦啦啦~",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_4.text": "下一秒？砰。惊澜龙突然贴脸杀。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_5.text": "我说老兄，你到底是从哪儿冒出来的？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_6.text": "而且它们还吃海豚。是不是超可爱？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_7.text": "还有什么？哦对。毒。超多超多的毒。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_8.text": "那这条龙都会干些什么？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_9.text": "多得很。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_10.text": "我数数……撕咬、角顶、利爪、水息或毒息。毒液球。钻地。腾空冲撞——",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_11.text": "而且它们会飞、在陆地上也如鱼得水，还会游泳……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_12.text": "这到底是什么龙？这到底是个什么东西？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_13.text": "到底是什么让它们进化出这些的？北海巨妖？克苏鲁？还是某种更大更凶恶的海龙？？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_14.text": "它们太吓人了。我讨厌碰上它们。除非心里有底，否则我会绕道走。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_15.text": "要是逼不得已非得驯一只惊澜龙？我会做最坏的打算。能囤的东西全囤上。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_16.text": "至少你能用它们掉的尖刺制作箭矢……这么算也不亏，对吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_17.text": "不过嘿，瞧瞧你自己，%1$s。你做到了！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_18.text": "你驯服了一只惊澜龙！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_volitans.volitans_19.text": "恭喜恭喜。你可真是个了不起的人。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.20": "关于我的虚颚龙，你能跟我讲点什么？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_1.text": "嗯……它们相当与众不同。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_2.text": "既然你养了它，那八成已经知道它的本事了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_3.text": "传送、隐身、免疫潜影贝导弹，都是些相当酷的能力。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_4.text": "而且光看着它们就让人心生宁静。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_5.text": "成双成对地在末地荒原上飘来飘去。吃着紫颂果，欺负着潜影贝。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_6.text": "对周围发生的一切漠不关心。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_7.text": "如果我能转世并且可以选择？我绝对不要当虚颚龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_8.text": "我为什么要这么说？不知道。随口一说。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_nulljaw.nulljaw_9.text": "总之，能驯服一只，干得不错。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.21": "对我的凛煞龙有什么想法吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_1.text": "Atroxia regalis。这个嘛？这名字？可不是我编的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_2.text": "这个分类是龙类研究学会正式认可的。要怪就怪他们。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_3.text": "真是一头迷人的龙。我从没见过这种体型构造的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_4.text": "不过这不就等于永远都在做有氧运动吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_5.text": "就两条主要肢体，没有后腿，没有翅膀……却结实得仿佛认定大山都得先给它挪地方。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_6.text": "几乎全靠那两条前臂。行走、攀爬，还有撑起整个躯干……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_7.text": "我觉得尾巴也算得上，因为它差不多就是第三个支撑点。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_8.text": "而且那条尾巴绝对不只是用来保持平衡的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_9.text": "它尾巴尖特别漂亮。我能盯着看一整天。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_10.text": "上面闪耀着金光。在雪地里看更是绝了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_11.text": "如果关于它冰系法术的记载属实，我敢打赌大部分能量都是从那里传导出去的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_12.text": "那头型让我想起埃及的奈美斯头巾。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_13.text": "金色的纹饰，眼周的斑纹……非常有法老的风范。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_14.text": "讽刺的是，这种龙偏偏生活在寒冷地带。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_15.text": "一头为古埃及盛装打扮的霜龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_16.text": "大自然完全不在乎什么主题一致性。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_17.text": "……呵。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_18.text": "我打赌这家伙能做俄式挺身。哈哈！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_19.text": "看看那肩膀。它绝对行！",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_20.text": "干得好，%1$s。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.dragon_atroxiia.atroxiia_21.text": "你一天又一天地给我带来惊喜。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.22": "你一直是商人吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_1.text": "不是。我以前大多是一个人赶路。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_2.text": "探险、采集、做笔记……诸如此类。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_3.text": "做生意是后来的事了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_3.choice.0": "为什么？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_4.text": "这个嘛，除了用龙的部件换蛋之外，我也卖别的东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_5.text": "吃的要钱。装备要钱。修理要钱。什么都得花钱。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_6.text": "而且显然，有些人愿意为我本来就一直随身带着的东西掏不少钱。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_7.text": "我的常规买卖大多跟村民做，自然就离不开绿宝石了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_8.text": "为什么是绿宝石？不知道。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_9.text": "你是想说我得爬上能想象到的最高山峰才能找到一些，就为了换一桶鳕鱼？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_10.text": "这也太……不值了吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_11.text": "至少他们会先用绿宝石换你手里的寻常物件。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_11.choice.0": "所以你就这么当上商人了？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_12.text": "差不多吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_13.text": "这也让我有理由在各聚落之间往来，还不会太引人注目。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_13.choice.0": "……这话听着有点可疑啊。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trader_history.trader_14.text": "有吗？别想太多。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.23": "你喜欢做生意吗？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_1.text": "有时候喜欢吧。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_2.text": "我喜欢帮人找到他们真正需要的东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_3.text": "或者单纯是帮帮别人。让人脸上露出笑容。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_4.text": "食物、材料、工具、补给……这部分让人觉得自己有用。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_5.text": "偶尔聊聊天我也挺享受。交易本身也可以很愉快。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_6.text": "但讨价还价？免了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_7.text": "我讨厌讨价还价。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_7.choice.0": "是吗？你看起来挺擅长的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_8.text": "哈！擅长一件事可不代表我喜欢做。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_9.text": "我也很擅长从发怒的野生动物手底下逃跑。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_10.text": "练出了不少耐力。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_11.text": "我推荐的是锻炼，不是野生动物。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_12.text": "我可没把那当娱乐项目。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_13.text": "再说，做生意也给了我一个结识他人的由头，还不用在他们身边久留。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_13.choice.0": "这话听着有点不合群啊。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_14.text": "……有吗？我觉得听着挺高效的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_15.text": "总之，这种事情做多了自然就熟练了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_16.text": "从一个人愿意拿什么来换，能看出很多东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_17.text": "有人要食物。有人要工具。还有人不知为何死活要三组腐肉，原因我不打算深究。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_trading_opinion.trading_18.text": "谁知道呢？说不定我巧舌如簧、谈判本领吓人的名声早晚会传开。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.24": "在这些之前，你都是做什么的？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_1.text": "做生意之前？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_1.choice.0": "嗯。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_2.text": "我大多是四处游荡，在我多半不该去的地方做出一些可疑的决定。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_3.text": "探险、采集植物、收集样本、画素描、记笔记。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_4.text": "我也对龙着迷。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_5.text": "但在很长一段时间里，我能找到的只有苔背兽。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_6.text": "而且……那些甚至都不是龙。对吧？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_7.text": "我从来没兴致去好好研究它们。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_8.text": "有人说那玩意儿能吃。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_9.text": "饶了我吧。这种事别扯上我。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_10.text": "不过我倒是找到过一处瓦拉鳄的巢。却没见到龙本身的踪影。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_11.text": "那挺奇怪的。我当时特别兴奋，终于能亲眼见上一面了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_12.text": "那时候我也常常见到烬翼龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_13.text": "起初看它们结伴飞行挺美好的。后来就有点……司空见惯了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_14.text": "总之。回到我实际做的事上来。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_15.text": "我喜欢弄清什么东西住在哪。什么长在哪。什么东西在哪能要了我的命。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_15.choice.0": "最后那条听起来挺有用。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_16.text": "是啊。非常有用。通常都是稍微学晚了点，但确实有用。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_17.text": "我也喜欢凡事亲力亲为。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_18.text": "我就是喜欢见识新的地方。找到那些只在前人书里读到过的东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_19.text": "尤其是龙。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_19.choice.0": "这么说，你以前是研究者？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_20.text": "嗯……不算。至少没有名分。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_21.text": "“带着笔记本的好奇女子”这个说法大概更准确。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_22.text": "龙类研究学会里可都是有正经资历的人。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_23.text": "我有的只是指甲缝里的泥，和几个非常自信的观点。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_23.choice.0": "听起来资历够够了。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_past_work.past_24.text": "求你千万别在学者面前这么说。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.known_greeting.return_prompt.choice.25": "你最喜欢的食物是什么？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.continue": "……",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_1.text": "嗯……这得看情况。你说的“最喜欢”，是指我平时实际吃的东西，还是我希望自己在吃的东西？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_1.choice.0": "都要。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_2.text": "平时实际吃的？面包、肉干、浆果，反正就是耐存放、又不会把肚子撑太饱的东西。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_3.text": "很精彩吧，我知道。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_4.text": "但我真正想吃的……还得是一顿像样的饭。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_5.text": "热腾腾、吃得饱、还不容易做砸。通常是这样。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_6.text": "烤马铃薯，弄得到的话再来点兔肉，一些面包，或许还有胡萝卜。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_7.text": "饭后再来块南瓜派。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_7.choice.0": "说得这么具体？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_8.text": "赶路的时候，我总会想吃的。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_9.text": "但要论真正的好吃的？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_10.text": "为了惠灵顿牛排，我能疯狂到不顾一切。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_11.text": "或者法式油封鸭。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_12.text": "或许还要一份黑椒牛排，配蘑菇烩饭。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_12.choice.0": "这从烤马铃薯跨越得有点大啊。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_13.text": "我可是内有乾坤。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_14.text": "然后我会用……黑咖啡，把这些统统送下肚。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_15.text": "我知道。我知道。别……别用那种眼神看我。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_16.text": "我就是爱黑咖啡。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_17.text": "还有2%牛奶。",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_17.choice.0": "一起喝？",
 "dialogue.saintsdragons.ivy.recruited_favorite_food.food_18.text": "……不。分开喝。"
}
